Voices. The speech in the wav files was synthesized with Kokoro, which is licensed under
Apache 2.0: Kokoro 82M by hexgrad (https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M), run through
kokoro-onnx (https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx). Credit for the voices belongs to the
Kokoro project. samples.json lists the voice used for each file.
